            0.525
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Have you also experienced some of these changes? If yes, then it is because you are also reaching this stage gradually. This stage starts around 10 years of age and can continue up to the age of 19. It is usually a stage of development between childhood and adulthood, and is called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "adolescence",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.525,
            0.743,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "While analysing Table 6.1, you might have noticed the following:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.558,
            0.384,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.095,
