        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.39,
            0.636,
            0.584,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Increase in height"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.389,
            0.658,
            0.863,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "From birth, our body undergoes continuous growth and development including an increase in height. However, the increase in height becomes more prominent during adolescence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.814,
            0.585,
            0.853
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Changes in body structure, weight gain, and strength"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.854,
            0.587,
            0.906
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As boys grow, it might be seen that along with growing taller, they gain weight, their shoulders might become a bit broader, and their chests may get wider."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.905,
            0.585,
            0.942
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Girls also undergo changes in height and weight, and other body changes like development of breasts."
            }
          ]
        },
